province = 74
blurb = "Depicts a small wooden bridge over a garden pond.

This was part of a series illustrating the estate of the Iwasaki family, founders of the Mitsubishi conglomerate. The series was allegedly commissioned by the company as gifts for their clients, though I have not been able to reliably confirm this.

Today, this location in the Fukagawa district of Tōkyō is part of [url=https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3034_006.html]Kiyosumi Garden[/url], which is open to visitors."
